  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #532.\n\n`assets/posts/wire-iso.cps`. RS-274 motion words are posted directly. Condition select, compensation on/off and side, AWT thread/cut and wire-tip disposal come from `.mch` `edm.codes` (D5). A missing code refuses the post, naming the code. No vendor dialect is copied.\n\n**Done means:** the 2-axis contour posts a golden against the synthetic fixture dialect, and removing any required code refuses by name. The PR states \"not exercised on a real EDM control\" (D10).",
